OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial sites vandalised before
OL,4,ARemembrance events
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo vandalised war memorial sites will
OL,7,Fbe "pretty challenging" to clean but
OL,8,Fthey will be ready in time for
OL,9,FRemembrance Sunday, a council has
OL,10,Fvowed.
OL,12,FThe Lowestoft Naval Memorial, at Belle
OL,13,FVue Park, was sprayed with red paint,
OL,14,Fwhile a seating area near the town's
OL,15,FRoyal Plain war monument was covered in
OL,16,Fblack graffiti.
OL,18,FSuffolk Police said a 19-year-old had
OL,19,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of criminal
OL,20,Fdamage in connection with the Belle Vue
OL,21,FPark vandalism and bailed until 22
OL,22,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
